Title: Kirklees police officer charged with sexual assault
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'A West Yorkshire Police officer has been charged with sexual assault by touching, the force has said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 78}}, {'Description': "PC Jack Blagbrough, 31, works in the Kirklees District and is due to appear at Barnsley Magistrates' Court on 16 July.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 98}}, {'Description': 'The charge relates to an offence against a woman while the officer was off-duty.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 75}}, {'Description': 'West Yorkshire Police says it had suspended PC Blagbrough from duty since the start of the investigation.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 92}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Stock image of a police officer in hi-vis uniform walking away from camera'}]}
